# CMB Simulation DSL — Specification v1.0

## Purpose
A deterministic, identity‑encoded domain‑specific language for defining
entropy‑driven, order‑emergent, encrypted simulations.

---

## Core Types

type Entropy = float
type Order = float
type EncryptionCost = float
type Identity = {
  designer: string,
  signature: string
}

---

## Meta Equation Definition

equation U_CMB {
  inputs:
    S: Entropy
    O: Order
    E_enc: EncryptionCost
    I: Identity

  rule:
    maximize (S + λ_O * O - λ_E * E_enc)
    subject_to I
}

---

## Universe Object

object Universe_CMB {
  id: "cmb.unified.meta.v1"
  equation: U_CMB
  invariants:
    entropy_defines_time
    order_from_entropy_gradient
    encryption_seals_design
    identity_is_structural
}